{"id": "99210111", "name": "מספר הפתרונות בשלמים של x₁+…+xₙ=s – בלי אילוץ, עם אפס אחד לפחות, ועם חסם תחתון", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>נתונה המשוואה<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x_1+x_2+\\cdots+x_{ {{CT:0}} }={{CT:1}} \\]</p>כמה פתרונות יש לה במספרים שלמים, כאשר:</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_i\\ge 0\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-comb\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: עצרת מזינים עם סימן קריאה, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">5!</code>, ואת המקדם הבינומי \\(\\binom{n}{k}\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">binomial(n,k)</code>, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">binomial(10,3)</code>. אין צורך לחשב עד הסוף: אפשר להזין ביטוי, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">binomial(10,3)*5!/2^10</code>.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_i\\ge 0\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span>, ולפחות אחד מהמשתנים שווה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ג. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_i\\ge {{CT:2}}\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> פתרון במספרים אי-שליליים הוא חלוקה של כדורים זהים לתאים (בחירה עם החזרה ובלי חשיבות לסדר). ב: משלים; ג: הזזה של המשתנים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — בלי אילוץ</b><br>פתרון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_1+\\cdots+x_n=s\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_i\\ge0\\)</span> מתאים לחלוקת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s\\)</span> כדורים זהים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> תאים, ולכן יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\binom{s+n-1}{n-1}\\)</span> פתרונות:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\binom{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — לפחות אפס אחד</b><br>המשלים: כל המשתנים חיוביים. נציב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y_i=x_i-1\\ge0\\)</span>, ונקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y_1+\\cdots+y_{ {{CT:0}} }={{CT:6}}\\)</span>, עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\binom{ {{CT:7}} }{ {{CT:4}} }\\)</span> פתרונות. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:5}}-\\binom{ {{CT:7}} }{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:5}}-{{CT:8}}={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — חסם תחתון</b><br>נציב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y_i=x_i-{{CT:2}}\\ge0\\)</span>, ונקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y_1+\\cdots+y_{ {{CT:0}} }={{CT:10}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\binom{ {{CT:11}} }{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:12}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "if binomial(ss-1,nv-1)=t2 then -1 else binomial(ss-1,nv-1)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>זה מספר הפתרונות שבהם כל המשתנים חיוביים, כלומר המשלים. צריך להחסיר אותו מהמספר הכולל.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "t3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["cc", "nv", "ss", "t1", "t2", "t3"], "nvariants": 50}